  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frocketnode.com%252ffrankv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vMRt7Jf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"226\"></span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>此模组允许即使堆叠已满的掉落的物品也能合并。这有助于减少大量掉落物在小区域内引起的卡顿。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 它应该与大多数模组兼容，但如果与你玩的模组不兼容，请报告任何问题。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstaaaaaaaaaaaack%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">当前功能:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在不改变实际最大堆叠大小的情况下，合并超过堆叠极限的掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可自定义掉落物的合并距离。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可自定义掉落物的最大尺寸。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可自定义覆盖层大小和渲染距离。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可根据名称、标签或维度对白名单或黑名单中的项目进行配置，使其不会超过默认堆叠限制。你可以从通用配置文件中添加它们，或者为它们分配特定的物品标签。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">名字里有12个'a'，你知道的。🍔</span><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/myL7fuqp/images/ae86decac06068d8aed8af5aa82648d83b2ddb6e.gif\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ffrankV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/04c26dd8-c4e1-46b5-8681-e491675d41da.webp\" alt=\"Sorry but I really need that cool money\" width=\"810\" height=\"541\"></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我与RocketNode Hosting合作了！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Rocket